      "html": "<style>\n  .s4{position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;min-height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#F9F4EA;color:#2A2622;font-family:'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC',-apple-system,sans-serif;padding:4.6vw 6vw 3.8vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n  .s4 *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  .s4 .meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2vw;align-items:baseline;font-size:1vw;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#A08C74}\n  .s4 h2{margin:1.1vw 0 0;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',Georgia,serif;font-weight:600;font-size:3.6vw;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:.01em}\n  .s4 .path{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:0;margin-top:2.6vw;position:relative}\n  .s4 .step{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding-right:2.4vw}\n  .s4 .step:nth-child(1){flex:1.15}\n  .s4 .step:nth-child(2){flex:1}\n  .s4 .step:nth-child(3){flex:.85;padding-right:0}\n  .s4 .step .n{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:3.4vw;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#C9B9A2}\n  .s4 .step:nth-child(1) .n{color:#B8583C;font-size:4.4vw}\n  .s4 .step .rule{height:1px;background:rgba(42,38,34,.22);margin:1.5vw 0 1.4vw;position:relative}\n  .s4 .step:nth-child(1) .rule{background:#B8583C;height:2px}\n  .s4 .step .rule::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;bottom:-.35vw;width:.7vw;height:.7vw;border-radius:50%;background:#B8583C}\n  .s4 .step:nth-child(2) .rule::after{background:#C9B9A2}.s4 .step:nth-child(3) .rule::after{background:#C9B9A2}\n  .s4 .step h3{margin:0;font-size:1.9vw;font-weight:500;line-height:1.35;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',Georgia,serif}\n  .s4 .step:nth-child(3) h3{font-size:1.6vw}\n  .s4 .step p{margin:.85vw 0 0;font-size:1.1vw;line-height:1.7;color:#6E6255}\n  .s4 .step small{display:block;margin-top:auto;padding-top:1.6vw;font-size:.94vw;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#A08C74;line-height:1.5}\n  .s4 .foot{margin-top:1.6vw;padding-top:1.4vw;border-top:1px solid rgba(42,38,34,.16);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2vw;font-size:.98vw;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8A7C6C}\n</style>\n<div class=\"s4\">\n  <div class=\"meta\"><span>留白 · ROOM TO THINK</span><span>03 / 怎么用</span></div>\n  <h2>从发起到交付，三步。</h2>\n  <div class=\"path\">\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"n\">01</div><div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <h3>写清目标</h3>\n      <p>用一句话说清要解决的问题，附上必要的背景。写不出来，说明这件事还没准备好开工。</p>\n      <small>对应问题页第 1 条</small>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"n\">02</div><div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <h3>约定下一步</h3>\n      <p>指定推进的人和期限，把讨论收束成一个动作。谁做、什么时候，写在同一行。</p>\n      <small>对应问题页第 3 条</small>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"n\">03</div><div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <h3>交付并留档</h3>\n      <p>最终版本与关键决策留在项目里，交接时不必再问一遍。</p>\n      <small>对应问题页第 6 条</small>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"foot\"><span>推荐用法 · 可只采用其中一步</span><span>04 / 06</span></div>\n</div>"
    },
